{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636019335231569940","content":"One of our number is dead. Another is a close confidant of the captain. Another is not yet a member, but may be one yet (I beg of you, do not accept). Another has had their memory of Rah's death erased and then returned. The last writes this chronicle.","created_at":"2020-08-01T00:47:05.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738920710596067400","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
